 control over the front line, center, and flanks. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/bd136367bcbc9b5fe0339bde9be3ef5a.poster.avif?t=1778840563\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/bd136367bcbc9b5fe0339bde9be3ef5a.webm?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/bd136367bcbc9b5fe0339bde9be3ef5a.mp4?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge with me and achieve glory! Body collisions are divided into head, torso, and limbs. Striking different body parts causes different amounts of damage. Combined with martial arts combos in four directions, players can experience exhilarating, fluid combat. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/a3cde9d60a7a95399280384b2845df58.poster.avif?t=1778840563\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/a3cde9d60a7a95399280384b2845df58.webm?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/a3cde9d60a7a95399280384b2845df58.mp4?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three visits to the thatched cottage, the realm divided into three</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the strategic map, players can rise up, recruit troops and horses, marry and have children, swear brotherhood, create factions, build their own power, and contend with the great warlords for control of the Central Plains!</p>", "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to fight me for three hundred rounds! Players can engage in combat from a third-person perspective, charging and dueling with enemy generals right before the battle lines, experiencing the thrill of one-on-one duels! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/0b774907257b10878c46debf7f8e1d1e.poster.avif?t=1778840563\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/0b774907257b10878c46debf7f8e1d1e.webm?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/0b774907257b10878c46debf7f8e1d1e.mp4?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/d0745f8da5d1157478567879ec71b90d.poster.avif?t=1778840563\" width=1170 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/d0745f8da5d1157478567879ec71b90d.webm?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607240/extras/d0745f8da5d1157478567879ec71b90d.mp4?t=1778840563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan wisely and win a thousand miles away! When two armies clash, players can switch to an RTS perspective to personally command the battle, with direct control over 